{
  "name": "ListDesktopsConnectStatus",
  "summary": "查询桌面连接状态列表",
  "tags": "桌面",
  "productshort": "Workspace",
  "region_id": "af-north-1",
  "paths": {
    "/v2/{project_id}/connect-desktops": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Desktop"
        ],
        "summary": "查询桌面连接状态列表",
        "description": "查询桌面连接状态列表。",
        "operationId": "ListDesktopsConnectStatus",
        "schemes": [
          "https"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "project_id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "项目ID。",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255,
            "minLength": 1,
            "x-annotations": "@Size(max = 255, min = 1)",
            "x-example": "2b31ed520xxxxxxebedb6e57xxxxxxxx"
          },
          {
            "name": "user_names",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "桌面所属用户,批量筛选,最多不超过100个用户。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 0,
              "maxLength": 36
            },
            "maxItems": 100,
            "minItems": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "connect_status",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "桌面的连接状态。\n\n- UNREGISTER:表示桌面未注册时的状态(桌面启动后,会自动注册)。关机后也会出现未注册的状态。\n- REGISTERED:表示桌面注册以后,等待用户连接的状态。\n- CONNECTED:表示用户已经成功连接,正在使用桌面。\n- DISCONNECTED:表示桌面与客户端断开会话后显示的状态,可能为关闭客户端窗口,或客户端与桌面网络断开引起。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 255,
            "minLength": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "offset",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "从查询结果中的第几条数据开始返回,用于分页查询,取值范围0-2000,默认从0开始。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 0,
            "maximum": 100000,
            "minimum": 0
          },
          {
            "name": "limit",
            "in": "query",
            "description": "查询结果中想要返回的信息条目数量,用于分页查询,取值范围0-2000,默认值100。",
            "required": false,
            "type": "integer",
            "default": 100,
            "maximum": 1000,
            "minimum": 0
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
